# HippoRAG2 offline indices are large generated artifacts, not tracked here.
# Re-generate them locally from data/RAG-md-mouse/ and data/RAG-md-macaque/
# (see README for how to obtain the source papers).
data/rag-mouse/
data/rag-macaque/
data/RAG-md-mouse/*
data/RAG-md-macaque/*
!data/RAG-md-mouse/README.md
!data/RAG-md-macaque/README.md

# Local IDE config
.claude/
